  "id": "exposure-therapy",
  "term": "exposure therapy",
  "definition": "Exposure therapy is a type of cognitive behavioral therapy that is especially useful for phobias. It helps a person face the fears behind the phobia so they can do activities or enter situations they have been avoiding, and it may be combined with relaxation exercises.",
